From ca2e157e87c0568f8f0c7f51851b0c833ad6e7cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:01:20 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Generate a random check-in code for each Event

Adds events.checkin_code (1000-9999, unique). Event::save() fills it with Event::newCheckinCode() when a new record has no code, so it never comes from the form and never changes on update. Shown in the listing and in the show page.
